<h3>SQL Injection Demonstration (Educational Only)</h3>

<h4 style="color:red;">Vulnerable Search (String Concatenation)</h4>
<form asp-action="VulnerableSearch" method="post">
    <input type="text" name="username" style="width:400px" placeholder="Try: ' OR '1'='1" />
    <button type="submit">Search (Vulnerable)</button>
</form>

<h4 style="color:green;">Safe Search (Parameterized Query)</h4>
